    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"find a quiet, lasting peace instead of fighting the emptiness.\" \n\nwhat does that even mean? it just sounds like you're saying it's okay to just... stop. that there's no point in trying to rebuild when the foundation is gone.",
